        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises FEI-S-195  Square Modern Door Stop 1-5/8\" x 1\"</b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this square modern floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\nThe floor mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/modern-square-door-stop-field-enterprises-fei-s-185\"><b>1\" Square Modern Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware that includes screw for tile mount applications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises FEI-S-195 Square Modern Floor Mount Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Ring: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
